  "title": "Dill Gazpacho",
  "description": "This refreshing soup originates from Spain and is served ice cold. The base of the soup is made with fresh tomatoes, cucumber and peppers. For a smoother soup, puree more than half of the vegetables. If you prefer it chunky - don&#39;t puree them at all. It&#39;s even better if you can leave this soup overnight to allow the flavors to develop.",
