        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/K1A6iunUFGbqSOLLWzsLAfaVnF4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/89982-dill-gazpacho-VAT-001-step-01-d7dfdb3c295242a49c934c608613e8d5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/89982/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, stir together tomatoes, cucumber, onion, bell pepper, and jalapeno pepper. Season with lemon juice, balsamic vinegar, olive oil, salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dwChxf8xT3du1wk7NmCTHZg9XZk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/89982-dill-gazpacho-VAT-004-step-02-03-285b9c94988a4e0f94e84211e159d410.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/89982/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a blender or food processor, puree half of the mixture until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/koXKKdqfqKunwab_0b8CUlomQkE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/89982-dill-gazpacho-VAT-006-step-03-02-e0789fbf4eb74622a158fabf0a3b59d8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/89982/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return to bowl, stir in dill and mix well. Cover and chill for at least one hour before serving.",
